# Portal Charm (hidden quest portalCharm): a Windurst char (nation 2) in Heaven's Tower with two Rolanberries. Rank 2:
# the check fails: Kupipi's script (251). Rank 3 (a GM): her trigger, Prog 0: nil (her script's 251). A trade of two
# Rolanberries: not exactly one: nil. One: Written in the Stars not completed: 292; finished: the berry taken, Prog 1.
# The trigger, Prog 1 but the mission not completed: nil. The mission completed (a GM): 293; finished: quest:complete
# (the Portal Charm; Prog cleared). A trade with the charm held: nil.
# Kupipi+1 is the Kupipi a client sees (17768467, status normal); the first (17768466) is cutscene_only.
lists HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrade HeavensTower/onEventFinish/292 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/293
char zone=HeavensTower pos=2,0,30.9 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
rank 2
item Rolanberry x2
login
trigger Kupipi+1                          # rank 2: the check fails: her script
finish-if-event
rank 3
trigger Kupipi+1                          # Prog 0: nil: her script / quests
finish-if-event
trade Kupipi+1 Rolanberry x2              # not exactly one: nil
finish-if-event
trade Kupipi+1 Rolanberry x1              # the mission not completed: 292
finish                                  # the berry taken; Prog 1
trigger Kupipi+1                          # Prog 1, the mission not completed: nil (251)
finish-if-event
mission Windurst WrittenInTheStars current     # a GM: completeMission wants the mission current
mission Windurst WrittenInTheStars completed
trigger Kupipi+1                          # 293
finish                                  # complete: the Portal Charm
trade Kupipi+1 Rolanberry x1              # the charm held: nil
finish-if-event
